{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_CyMO-17.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/7/78/2006_CyMO-17.PNG/250px-2006_CyMO-17.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"223\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/7/78/2006_CyMO-17.PNG/375px-2006_CyMO-17.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/7/78/2006_CyMO-17.PNG/500px-2006_CyMO-17.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/6/4369ccb938d86d296fe34bff83b078419be8aaf9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$AB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" /> is equilateral triangle of side <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/f/10f32377ac67d94f764f12a15ea987e88c85d3e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\alpha$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/d/bbd228bf197e76246f7a62cd1f6fda8dde37f444.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A\\Delta=BE=\\frac{\\alpha}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"120\" height=\"33\" />. The measure of the angle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/0/a70f1f940059b7922b49b98c1647eb93369693c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle\\Gamma PE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/7/ca7350473d9ceb3fac52b94ff8f67121cada3f46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ 60^\\circ\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ 50^\\circ\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ 40^\\circ\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 45^\\circ\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ 70^\\circ$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"424\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Label point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/7/d871b4dc1bb09aae4fb7153807fca72fc91b2f3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/a/9aaf2c258ceeb79371b8a370b1b4910181853c82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma F=\\frac{\\alpha}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"64\" height=\"33\" />.\n</p><p>By symmetry we see that the triangle in the middle is equilateral, so the measure of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/0/a70f1f940059b7922b49b98c1647eb93369693c7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\angle\\Gamma PE$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/d/08d5c45388de5c75af641c046d466de3592ffa98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60^{\\circ}$\" width=\"24\" height=\"13\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/2/ca2f4283cfd441270cb90bfd2cf89a533f3dde81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_16\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_2\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_3\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_4\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_5\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_6\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_7\" 